#ASSERT `Do I commit the offence of pretending to be an authorised witness` `as the witness` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Do I commit the offence of pretending to be an authorised witness` `as the witness` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Do I commit the pretending offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `Do I commit the offence of pretending to be an authorised witness` `as the maker` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

-- What is the longest imprisonment for pretending to be an authorised witness
#ASSERT `What is the longest imprisonment for pretending to be an authorised witness` `as the witness` EQUALS `imprisonment for months` 12
#ASSERT `What is the longest imprisonment for pretending to be an authorised witness` `as the witness` EQUALS `imprisonment for months` `What is the longest I can be imprisoned for pretending in months`
#ASSERT `What is the longest imprisonment for pretending to be an authorised witness` `as the maker` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

§§ `For both: witnessing remotely, and rubber stamps`

§§§ `ss 7(3), 9(3)(c), 12(3)(c), 15(2) (no situation input; both roles)`

-- Does the Act let me do this remotely or electronically
-- An oath by video link: yes (s 7(3)); a statutory declaration by link: not settled by this Act; an electronic signature: not settled. For the maker and the witness alike.
#ASSERT `Does the Act let me do this remotely or electronically` `as the maker` `swearing an oath or making an affirmation` EQUALS `the Act says` `yes: s 7(3) lets the oath or affirmation be taken by audio or video link`
#ASSERT `Does the Act let me do this remotely or electronically` `as the witness` `swearing an oath or making an affirmation` EQUALS `the Act says` `yes: s 7(3) lets the oath or affirmation be taken by audio or video link`
#ASSERT `Does the Act let me do this remotely or electronically` `as the maker` `making a statutory declaration` EQUALS `the Act says` `not settled by this Act: s 12(3)(c) needs the witness's presence, and no provision speaks of a link for a declaration`
#ASSERT `Does the Act let me do this remotely or electronically` `as the witness` `making a statutory declaration` EQUALS `the Act says` `not settled by this Act: s 12(3)(c) needs the witness's presence, and no provision speaks of a link for a declaration`
#ASSERT `Does the Act let me do this remotely or electronically` `as the maker` `signing my statutory declaration or affidavit electronically` EQUALS `the Act says` (`Does the Act let me do it remotely` `signing my statutory declaration or affidavit electronically`)
#ASSERT `Does the Act let me do this remotely or electronically` `as the witness` `signing my statutory declaration or affidavit electronically` EQUALS `the Act says` (`Does the Act let me do it remotely` `signing my statutory declaration or affidavit electronically`)

-- May I stamp my name beside my signature on the document
-- s 15(2): a stamp may imprint the name, not make the signature.
#ASSERT `May I stamp my name beside my signature on the document` `as the maker` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I stamp my name beside my signature on the document` `as the witness` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I stamp my name beside my signature on the document` `as the maker` EQUALS `yes if` `May I stamp my name beside my signature`
#ASSERT `May I stamp my name beside my signature on the document` `as the witness` EQUALS `yes if` `May I stamp my name beside my signature`
